  "body": "All agents buyers welcome, contact Jayden for conjunctional.\r\n\r\nA well-loved family home for more than a decade, now refreshed and vacant, with immediate possession and settlement to suit in time for the new school year.\r\n\r\nLooking for a home that combines excellent schooling, modern comfort and easy living? Do not miss this beautifully refreshed family home in the sought-after suburb of Bucklands Beach, where everyday convenience meets comfortable living.\r\n\r\nEducation is a standout feature here, with zoning for Pigeon Mountain Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College. Even better, Pigeon Mountain Primary and Bucklands Beach Intermediate are within easy walking distance, with a convenient shortcut walkway making the school run even easier. It's an ideal setting for families looking to make the most of these highly regarded school zones.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully refreshed in full throughout, the home features a near-new modern kitchen, bathrooms, fresh paintwork and refreshed flooring, creating a welcoming open space you can move into and enjoy. The practical layout offers three bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a walk-in-wardrobe, en-suite and a semi-ensuite.  The two master bedrooms provide flexibility to make the space your own, and dual heat pumps upstairs prioritising comfort year-round.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas with seamless wood laminate flooring create a clean and natural hub for everyday family life, whether you're preparing meals, spending time together or entertaining friends. Indoor-outdoor flow extends to the backyard garden and patio, offering a lovely spot for weekend barbecues, children's playtime or simply relaxing outdoors. \r\n\r\nNorth-facing orientation brings in plenty of natural light, while the easy-care garden means more time to enjoy life and less time on maintenance.\r\n\r\nA double garage with internal access adds everyday practicality. You'll also enjoy easy access to Eastern Beaches, Half Moon Bay Marina, Highland Park Shopping Centre and Howick Village, keeping shopping, dining and recreation within convenient reach.\r\n\r\nComfortable, refreshed and superbly positioned for family living, this is an opportunity to secure a home in a location that continues to appeal to families.\r\n\r\nContact Team Tina for more information or to arrange a viewing. We look forward to welcoming you.",
